WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Oh good, you got this video!

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:04.420
I’m glad, because it turns out that Facebook,

00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.780
and so on, don’t show us all our friends’ posts.

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:10.760
They just show us some… from some of our friends.

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:13.160
That’s why I ask for your email address

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:15.619
so we don’t get cut off.

00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:18.070
Now why might we be cut off?

00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:21.120
Well, sometimes I agree with conservatives,

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.360
and social media companies are accused of being…

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.720
biased against conservatives.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.640
against conservatives.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.020
biased against conservatives.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.260
Are they?

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.560
All the companies say

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.780
“our policies apply equally to everyone.”

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.580
For example, “You may not promote violence.”

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:38.280
[yelling]

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.420
But in Portland Oregon,

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.220
Antifa threw things at journalist Andy Ngo,

00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:45.489
because he criticized Antifa’s violence.

00:00:45.489 --> 00:00:46.880
At one point, they beat him,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.300
kicking and punching him in the head.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:51.820
[yelling]

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.379
The attack left Ngo with brain damage.

00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:57.000
But the attackers’ account is still up,

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.120
linking to their website that justifies the violence,

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:04.040
saying “if you rally the far-right to attack our city,

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:07.500
the community will stop you, however it can”

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.760
So what does that tell you?

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:11.740
That there's probably bias?

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:12.440
[Laughs]

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.520
Glenn Beck runs a big media operation called The Blaze,

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.520
which has millions of followers.

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.980
Voices on the right being silenced

00:01:19.980 --> 00:01:21.720
Lately he’s been charging that

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.280
social media companies push a leftist agenda.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.299
“They manipulate algorithms to reshape our world.”

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:29.750
Beck has not been banned.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:32.299
But he says Facebook has reduced his reach.

00:01:32.299 --> 00:01:34.600
You can post whatever you want.

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:36.950
We have the little higher wall here for you.

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:38.760
While I’m not a conservative,

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:41.560
I have noticed some weird stuff going on.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:44.460
My videos average more than a million views.

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:46.120
But when I did that one,

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.320
which included some criticism of Facebook.

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:52.860
That video got less than half as many views.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:55.979
Because Facebook didn’t show it to many people?

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.200
I can’t know.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.800
That’s secret.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.619
For those who seek to push hate …

00:02:01.619 --> 00:02:04.260
Today, social media companes are pressured

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:06.720
to cut off anyone spreading hate.

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:10.209
You have no place on our platforms.

00:02:10.209 --> 00:02:11.820
[Applause]

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:14.340
Now, YouTube and Facebook say they even demote

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:17.520
content that almost violates policies.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.800
We do not allow hate groups on Facebook overall.

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:21.420
They're shaping you.

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.120
[yelling]

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.160
As an example of how they

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:25.620
treat some groups differently,

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.640
Beck points out that Twitter and Facebook leave up

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:31.510
Antifa accounts that promote violence.

00:02:31.510 --> 00:02:35.160
In Austin they were actually calling for the

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:39.940
next phase to have people be a paramilitary operation.

00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:41.720
That was up forever.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.010
It’s still up.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:45.520
It links to a manifesto calling for their opponents

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:48.260
to be “beaten bloody… annihilated.”

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:50.840
By contrast, Beck says conservative accounts

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:54.260
are censored merely for making fun of Democrats.

00:02:54.269 --> 00:02:58.490
The opportunity to do something historic.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.260
Remember the person who slowed down Pelosi

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.670
and they were outed, outed.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:04.820
Facebook did say

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:07.849
“we dramatically reduced its distribution.”

00:03:07.849 --> 00:03:10.380
The person who was in charge happened to be

00:03:10.380 --> 00:03:14.340
one of the leaders in Nancy Pelosi's office

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:17.930
who had just left Nancy Pelosi's office to go to work.

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:19.959
Well, did that play a role?

00:03:19.959 --> 00:03:21.720
They must hire some Republicans, too.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.180
They do, but it's about 20%

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:27.420
and they're not from top level positions.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:30.340
Zuckerberg met with 15 conservative leaders.

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:33.480
Facebook once invited Beck and others to discuss

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.610
accusations that Facebook censors conservatives.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:37.760
Sitting with Zuckerberg,

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:41.900
who is either not really running his company,

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:45.970
is naive, or a liar.

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:48.189
I don't know which.

00:03:48.189 --> 00:03:51.380
But I sat with him and he said,

00:03:51.380 --> 00:03:52.610
“Why would we do that?

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:53.640
Why would we do that?"

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:55.720
And okay, I agree with you.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.159
I want to believe you.

00:03:57.159 --> 00:03:58.769
Why would they tick off half the country?

00:03:58.769 --> 00:04:01.890
Why would they tick off half of the people, you know?

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:04.349
And so I want to believe him.

00:04:04.349 --> 00:04:07.560
However, your actions don't match.

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.840
Beck was also unhappy

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.030
with some of his fellow conservatives.

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.220
There were some conservatives

00:04:12.220 --> 00:04:13.360
that were there who said,

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.219
"Well, Mark, you can solve this

00:04:15.219 --> 00:04:18.389
by basically having affirmative action.

00:04:18.389 --> 00:04:20.200
Making sure that for every liberal you hire,

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.480
you hire ..." I don't want that.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:23.760
Was there any talk about saying,

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.210
look, we're just a platform.

00:04:26.210 --> 00:04:27.730
We shouldn't be doing any of this.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.140
We should just run everything that-

00:04:29.140 --> 00:04:30.460
No.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:31.240
Nobody even brought it up?

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:31.740
No.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:34.400
It bothers me that there are so many conservatives

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:36.240
that want more regulation.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:37.860
We don't need more regulation.

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:38.985
But it’s human nature,

00:04:38.985 --> 00:04:40.960
whenever we see something we don’t like, to say,

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.680
“Government must do something.”

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.590
Even Beck fell prey to that.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.520
Remember when Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:51.340
visited the border and claimed she saw immigrants

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:55.520
Being told by CBP officers to drink out of the toilet.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.100
Beck was so upset by that,

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.800
he said she should be punished.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.320
"I would like to prosecute

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:06.150
anyone who is making outrageous charges like this."

00:05:06.150 --> 00:05:10.880
So you want prosecution of one of the 500

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:12.820
members of Congress who says nonsense?

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.860
No.

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:14.740
Half of them say nonsense.

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.500
I mean, John, first of all,

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.960
I speak five hours off script everyday.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:23.920
So, you're not eager to prosecute Cortez?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.100
No.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:25.960
No.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.020
No.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:29.220
I’m glad he walked that back.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:33.070
Truth comes out through argument, open debate.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:35.040
The more social media companies censor,

00:05:35.040 --> 00:05:37.250
the less we learn.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:38.720
On at least some platforms,

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:40.710
all speech should be free.

00:05:40.710 --> 00:05:43.930
And I’m glad Beck agreed with that.

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:46.550
You would have them publish everything?

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:48.190
Stop all this censorship?

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:48.920
Yes.

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:49.900
Just let people say whatever?

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:50.720
Yep.

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:51.700
Yep.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:52.740
We can handle it.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.280
Stop treating us like children.

